"Go to <strong>console.firebase.google.com</strong> → <strong>Create a project</strong> (the free Spark plan, no card needed).": "Ve a <strong>console.firebase.google.com</strong> → <strong>Crear un proyecto</strong> (el plan gratuito Spark, sin tarjeta).",
